{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SpelBrawl</strong> is a fast-paced roguelite word game that combines strategy, skill, and a dash of luck. Every round challenges you to craft words, rewarding clever plays and sharp thinking with powerful upgrades for every challenge you complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the challenge solo and unlock an arsenal of game-changing items: cast devastating spells, use intervals to shift the game in your favor, and unlock unique characters that can extend your words in unexpected ways. Along the way, you\u2019ll discover a variety of surprises to keep every run fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Push your limits and claim the highest score every round!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/50fc8cc9856bf0207e8e14b32a072e0c.poster.avif?t=1768201243\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/50fc8cc9856bf0207e8e14b32a072e0c.webm?t=1768201243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Use the reroll spell to reshape the game in your favor!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/a8f1002bf4163d9761a7c0bda22f847b.poster.avif?t=1768201243\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/a8f1002bf4163d9761a7c0bda22f847b.webm?t=1768201243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Chain multipliers to skyrocket your score!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/ecc67fd69c7944668a1eb146692b1fca.poster.avif?t=1768201243\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/ecc67fd69c7944668a1eb146692b1fca.webm?t=1768201243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i><strong>Conquer the challenge by completing the items on the To-Do list!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/2a83fdc45dbefda2c9e28f3bdb8e7981.poster.avif?t=1768201243\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/extras/2a83fdc45dbefda2c9e28f3bdb8e7981.webm?t=1768201243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918980?t=1768201243","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/d98aa650eaed394aeaa5210d4a4072df900da7fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768201243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/1ad91c0d6703362c8293e61cb1142074932d9ca8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768201243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918980/1ad91c0d6703362c8293e61cb1142074932d9ca8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768201243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"d